+When the SetupIntent succeeds, it creates a new *PaymentMethod* (PaymentMethods represent your customer's payment instruments, used with the Payment Intents or Setup Intents APIs) attached to either a customer-configured [Account](https://docs.stripe.com/api/v2/core/accounts/object.md) or a [Customer](https://docs.stripe.com/api/customers.md). You can use these to initiate future payments without having to prompt the customer for their bank account a second time.
+
+#### Accounts v2
+
+```curl
+curl https://api.stripe.com/v1/payment_intents \
+  -u "<<YOUR_SECRET_KEY>>:" \
+  -d "automatic_payment_methods[enabled]=true" \
+  -d "customer_account={{CUSTOMERACCOUNT_ID}}" \
+  -d "payment_method={{PAYMENTMETHOD_ID}}" \
+  -d confirm=true \
+  -d amount=100 \
+  -d currency=nzd \
+  -d off_session=true
+```
+
+#### Customers v1
+
+```curl
+curl https://api.stripe.com/v1/payment_intents \
+  -u "<<YOUR_SECRET_KEY>>:" \
+  -d "automatic_payment_methods[enabled]=true" \
+  -d "customer={{CUSTOMER_ID}}" \
+  -d "payment_method={{PAYMENTMETHOD_ID}}" \
+  -d confirm=true \
+  -d amount=100 \
+  -d currency=nzd \
+  -d off_session=true
 ```
 
